Template
--------

[ Root Component ]
 ├─ Name: optional-name
 ├─ < other attributes >
 │
 ├─ [ Parent Component A ]
 │   ├─ Role: optional-role
 │   ├─ < other attributes >
 │   │
 │   ├─ (1) Action name: optional summary
 │   │     * action detail
 │   │     * action detail
 │   │
 │   ├─ [ Child Component A ]
 │   └─ [ Child Component B ]
 │       └─ < other attributes or actions >
 │
 ├─ [ Parent Component B ]
 │   ├─ Role: optional-role
 │   └─ < other attributes or actions >
 │
 ├─ Links:
 │  ├─ [ Child Component A ]
 │  │  --> [ Parent Component B ]: relationship
 │  │
 │  └─ [ Parent Component A ]
 │     --> [ Parent Component B ]: relationship                              
 │     <-> [ Root Component ]: relationship
 │
 └─ < other components >

Legend:
[ ] = component
(n) = action
--> = one-way relationship
<-> = two-way relationship
< > = placeholder
